        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aguada%2C_Puerto_Rico",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The former Coloso Sugar Cane Refinery now houses the Aguada Museum, preserving the town's sugarcane heritage.",
